"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T21:02:15Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T21:02:15Z","body":"reduz says `tap_back` seems useless — it may have been there to adjust the latency manually, but there should be no need for that if `get_output_latency` works as expected.\r\n\r\nSo I think all in all we're good to remove it! Thank you for pushing this forward. The PR just needs a review and testing now.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807520054/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829858900","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114355#issuecomment-3829858900","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114355","id":3829858900,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kRwJU","user":{"login":"Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo","html_url":"https://github.com/Akosmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T00:35:08Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T00:35:08Z","body":"> Regarding the feature: There is something to be said about running window FFTs, which is probably what this code was supposed to implement. However, since it was incorrect, I think we should remove it. If the functionality is needed, we can (properly) re-add it in the future.\r\n\r\nI'm a little confused about this, and I might be misunderstanding you. Are you talking about window functions? One is applied at L116 on the .cpp file (L115 in this PR). I can't tell if there's any spectral leakage, but I don't think there's any problem with that part of the code, and `tap_back_pos` is not related to it. A window function is needed to reduce spectral leakage, and one is already implemented.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3829858900/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3830666007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114355#issuecomment-3830666007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114355","id":3830666007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kU1MX","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T08:58:56Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T08:58:56Z","body":"No, I'm talking about using previous values to decrease reaction time via running windows (analogous to how a running mean uses previous values with a mean).\nHowever, I'm not suggesting thus should be implemented, or even that it's useful with this implementation. Just that it might be what the tap back pos was supposed to accomplish.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3830666007/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3831821481","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114355#issuecomment-3831821481","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114355","id":3831821481,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kZPSp","user":{"login":"Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo","html_url":"https://github.com/Akosmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/events{/privacy}","received_eve